  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00583424_CompensationForExecutiveMemberOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">회사성과 및 개인 기여도에 따른 달성률을 바탕으로 약정된 지급률에 해당하는 자사주를 대상 경영자에게 지급. 단, 회사가 지급수단을 선택할 수 있음(주식 또는 현금)</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:DateOfGrantOfSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00583424_RewardsForPurchaseOfTreasurySharesMemberOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">- 2022년 5월, 11월 지급
- 2023년 11월 지급</ifrs-full:DateOfGrantOfSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:DateOfGrantOfSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00583424_OtherLongtermEmployeeBenefitsMemberOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">- 2022년 부터 매년 대상  직원에게 지급</ifrs-full:DateOfGrantOfSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfVestingRequirementsForSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00583424_RewardsForPurchaseOfTreasurySharesMemberOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">- 용역제공 조건 : 해당 년도(재원산정회계기간) 근무기간 비례 지급
- 자사주 매입 직원 대상</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfVestingRequirementsForSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfVestingRequirementsForSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00583424_OtherLongtermEmployeeBenefitsMemberOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">- 용역제공 조건: 10년</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfVestingRequirementsForSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00583424_RewardsForPurchaseOfTreasurySharesMemberOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">전년 대비 관리회계기준 성장이익의 5%를 재원으로,이에 상응하는 주식수를 산정하여 자사주를 직원에게 부여. 단, 자사주를 매입한 직원에게만 부여하며 리워드 비율은 2:1임 (매입 주수:주식리워드)</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00583424_OtherLongtermEmployeeBenefitsMemberOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementsMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">10년 근속 대상자에게 금 10돈의 가치에 상응하는 주식수를 산정하여 자사주 지급</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfShareOptionsInSharebasedPaymentArrangement>
